\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Log-log plots of computation times for symmetric BPS matrices versus $n$ across four distinct parameter sets $(\ell , r)$. The left panel (a) illustrates the isolated $RQ$ computation cost, while the right panel (b) presents the cumulative execution time encompassing both the complete structured $QR$ factorization and the subsequent $RQ$ product. The dashed reference lines possess a slope of 1, indicating strict $O(n)$ linear scaling for both components.}}{29}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
